  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-26T17:23:30.770Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When making avatars from scratch it helps us out a lot to know if a model would be proportionate to our bodies. The only time we can see our trackers is when we either calibrate or when we open our menu. Adding the option to see our trackers even when we are calibrated would honestly help us out in the avatar creation and editing process.",
